              "fill": "$text-primary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "No side column. Hermes and the rooms are the Dashboard’s own tab bar, the team is a band of cards above one thread that runs the full width, and what became of each message sits in the margin beside it.",
